I believe it works as follows (if you're carrying at least one luckstone
in your main inventory):

- start with n=0.
- for every blessed luckstone you're carrying in your main inventory,
  add 1 to n.
- for every cursed luckstone you're carrying in your main inventory,
  subtract 1 from n.

If the resulting number is:

positive: add 3 to your luck, and good luck will not time out for you
negative: bad luck will not time out for you
zero:     add 3 to your luck, and luck will not time out for you

